{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳於11月8日向員工發電郵承認與中國籍女子黃樂發生婚外情，事件震驚全球之際，意外令張家輝於1 …</p><p></p>\n<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳於11月8日向員工發電郵承認與中國籍女子黃樂發生婚外情，事件震驚全球之際，意外令張家輝於17年前受訪片段再度炒熱！張家輝今日（14日）出席《大娛樂騷》記者會時，親自回應被網民封為人間清醒。家輝哥剖白昔日言論，更一語道破男人最真實考量！</p>\n<h2>張家輝親解「不偷食論」神預言之謎</h2>\n<p>張家輝今日現身《大娛樂騷》記者會，隨即被傳媒追問關於黃仁勳出軌風波引發連鎖反應。事緣黃仁勳公開承認婚外情後，大批網民翻出張家輝於2009年接受鄭丹瑞訪問片段，並大讚其言論完全看透世事。面對外界將其昔日分享視為先知級別教典，張家輝表現得相當淡定，並未有因為網民盛讚而沾沾自喜，反而選擇以最直接坦白方式拆解大眾對其預言家身分迷思。</p>\n<h2>拒認人間清醒 直斥出軌源於僥倖心態</h2>\n<p>對於被捧上神枱，張家輝在受訪時直接否認自己具備先知能力，更表明不認同自己特別有見地。他坦言出軌行為本質純粹是出於私慾，並直接指出不少人進行這類行為時往往抱持僥倖心態。張家輝表示：「我唔係先知，又唔係人間清醒，大家每次去做時都把住僥倖心態，無人發現，成日都係呢個位，呢個係咩罪名呀，都係衰鹹濕，成日以為無人知，尤其你愛我熱烈就唔記得有冇人知，正如佢都被拍到攬攬錫錫。呢啲嘢都係自己選擇，你能夠做到無人知咪去做。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464460990535667_4854993016af81a8266c0f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6323140223310697270_w.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464460990535667_4854993016af81a8266c0f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張家輝表示：「呢個係咩罪名呀，都係衰鹹濕，成日以為無人知。」</figcaption></figure></p>\n<p>（圖片來源：東方新地）\n</p>\n<h2>昔日訪問翻hit揭露拒絕越軌真實原因</h2>\n<p>回顧這段時隔17年再度爆紅訪問片段，當時張家輝向鄭丹瑞直認無時無刻都會面對誘惑，但最終未有越軌全因現實考量。他解釋出軌代價極大，不僅會失去妻子及破壞家庭，更會令辛苦建立事業與人生一切毀於一旦。張家輝在當年訪問中明確指出：「你唔好話驚冇咗個老婆，破壞咗個家庭，係連帶我嘅事業，我整個人嘅一切，佢就係為咗我去偷一偷情，然後我咁努力工作，建立自己嘅家庭，擁有嘅事業，就為咗一次去偷，所有嘢要換晒？」他坦言權衡輕重後覺得這筆帳完全「唔襟計」，因此不敢行差踏錯。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚家輝哥昔日言論貼地</h2>\n<p>不少網民留言表示「張家輝真係人間清醒」、「講得好啱，為咗一時快感放棄成個森林根本唔值得」，對其理智分析表示極度認同。同時亦有網民針對黃仁勳公開承認出軌一事發表意見，有人認為「有錢人就係多誘惑」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461238138603_16311810456af81a84a8a80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-891HomeSweetHome10-YouTube-4’30”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461238138603_16311810456af81a84a8a80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>回顧這段時隔17年再度爆紅訪問片段，當時張家輝向鄭丹瑞直認無時無刻都會面對誘惑，但最終未有越軌全因現實考量。（圖片來源：NowTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17946446129081961_9384304676af81a85548d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20241004135542_e5bd633f77e772c2eefb2d8d75421045b8b02434.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17946446129081961_9384304676af81a85548d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張家輝經常放閃，曾在節目中唱情歌送給關詠荷。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461452475936_14290456696af81a86db47d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"-2026-05-10-6.42.53_12211486716a00616c5fd15-1024x695.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461452475936_14290456696af81a86db47d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>今年10月，61歲關詠荷孖老公現身農夫紅館騷（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461583352051_17179642276af81a88485f2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6323140223310697262_w.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464461583352051_17179642276af81a88485f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>對於被捧上神枱，張家輝在受訪時直接否認自己具備先知能力，更表明不認同自己特別有見地。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82%e9%a8%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大娛樂騷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e5%ae%b6%e8%bc%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張家輝</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e4%bb%81%e5%8b%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃仁勳</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542911\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:43:07.050184+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1491,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:23:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:41.210508+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:32.806979+00:00","content_hash":"cbdac48732368374510366b060fdfb2bd95cc04a6f9c37bf36938b31a9aad840","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}